                      "fill": "$Color / Text Slate",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "This page explains what Codenames Online stores about you, why it is stored, and how long it is kept. The game only collects what it needs to run accounts and matches.",
